                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "Which launch plan\nserves every\nrequired stop\nwithout exceeding\nthe measured",
                                  "limit? The choice\nof future emphasis\ndoes not add\npressure today.\nSlush offers to",
                                  "buy brighter paint\nfor the arch\ninstead. You must\ndecide whether it\ncan run now, not",
                                  "whether it would\nphotograph well or\nwhether someone\ncan afford its\nconstruction."
                                ],
